Article 18
The obligations and responsibilities of the Village Government as referred to in Article 15 letter b include:
a. establishing policies for the protection of women and children at the village level; b. implementing policies for the protection of women and children from acts of violence;
c. conducting cooperation with all parties in the implementation of protection of women and children;
