e. allocating budget for the implementation of protection of women and children, in accordance with the village's financial capacity;
f. involving community institutions at the village level in supporting the protection of women and children;
g. creating institutions at the village level to provide protection for women and children;
h. formulating regulations at the village level that govern the protection of women and children; and
